Today I am learning to make coffee.
Jessy is standing next to me.
I try to make my first coffee.
First, I take the milk jug.
But, I don't know how to hold it correctly.
I tilt it too much.
The steam comes out fast.
I struggle to froth the milk.
The milk became too hot.
No froth came in it at all.
Making my first coffee went completely wrong!
I laugh nervously.
"Sorry Jessy, this didn't come out right," I say.
Jessy looks at me and smiles.
"No problem Maya," she says.
"Everyone's first coffee is like this."
